          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's the difference between fly tying materials and supplies?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Materials go on the hook: feathers, beads, shanks, dubbing, flash. Tools and adhesives are supplies. Different job, different aisle.</p>"
